<%# locals: (record:, column:, value:) %>
<%# Overrides spree_admin's Shipment State column cell: when the order is
  fully delivered (see Spree::Admin::ShipmentDeliveryHelper#order_delivered_badge
  — ALL shipments delivered, same rule as the order header badge), show the
  green "Delivered" badge INSTEAD OF "Shipped" in this same column.
  Reuses the existing helper; no delivered-checking logic is duplicated here. %>
<%= order_delivered_badge(record) || order_shipment_state(record) %>
